  Owner-approved waiver (chat, 2026-11-24). Expires 2026-12-31: after that the findings fail the build again until
  re-reviewed. Reachability analysis: docs/security/residual-risk.md
-->
<suppressions xmlns="https://jeremylong.github.io/DependencyCheck/dependency-suppression.1.3.xsd">
  <suppress until="2026-12-31Z">
    <notes>
      Spring Framework 6.2.19, no fixed 6.2.x available. Affected features are not used by this application:
      XsltView, WebFlux (Aalto XML, functional endpoints, WebSocket, Jetty adapter, PartEventHttpMessageReader),
      RSocket, SSE view fragments / functional SSE, SpEL evaluation of user-supplied expressions or SimpleEvaluationContext,
      and data binding of user-supplied property paths. See docs/security/residual-risk.md.
    </notes>
